22:35.520 --> 22:36.410
Cepat, cepat.

22:38.270 --> 22:38.840
Jangan macam-macam.

22:38.860 --> 22:39.540
- Jangan bergerak.
- Jangan bergerak.

22:41.600 --> 22:42.190
Dia orangnya.

22:54.660 --> 22:55.310
